    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0363" n="1197" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1197"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 657.119/739</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Norway</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Schmedeman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-24T17:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 24, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>436. For Dye [from War Trade Board]:</p>
                <p>No. 52. Your undated No. 989, received August 11, <hi rendition="#italic">re</hi>
                    corkmakers’ agreement.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d301-f1"/> We have no record of any
                    cable despatched to you <pb facs="0364" n="1198" xml:id="pg1198"/> on July 24, 6
                    p.m., and numbered 396. If you refer to our No. 396, July 26, 4 p.m., then you
                    are authorized to sign, provided the final form of the agreement is identical
                    with the draft submitted to the War Trade Board by Sheldon in his despatch of
                    June 7,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d301-f2"/> which he tells us he has sent to you. If
                    there have been any modifications of this draft, cable them to us and do not
                    sign until you are further authorized.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
